--Description / Thinking process:
-- To obtain an approximate token count for each article’s body, we need to:
-- 1) Convert the body text to lowercase for uniformity (LOWER).
-- 2) Split the lowercase string on the space character (' ') with SPLIT(), which returns an array of tokens.
